{"about_the_game":"This VR game is a time machine. You don't get to choose where you go. When you pull the lever, its random.<br><br>You receive a date telling you where you are in time and the doors open. There's no way of predicting where you'll end up.<br><br>You can't leave the time machine - but you can stick your head out, but be warned sometimes you might not want to.<br><br><strong>Where might I end up?</strong><br><br>You might end up somewhere significant or you might end up somewhere totally ordinary. <br><br>If you don't like where you are then you pull the lever again.<br><br>Have fun!<br><br><strong>Controls</strong><br><br>The game takes place in a single 2x3m room. You can use teleport and smooth locomotion to move around in the limited space if you would like to play sitting down. Its best played roomscale.<br><br><strong>This is a VR game but you will optionally be able to play it in first person mode.</strong>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2707810?t=1757122950","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707810/0054aac222e4321571682356ab6b0a98cc7400da/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757122950","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707810/8cfa3ee123239fd3fd3d2f69748204a284516486/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757122950","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707810/8cfa3ee123239fd3fd3d2f69748204a284516486/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757122950","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":nul